 "folded": "Nov 16, 2026: retired. It competed with Norman Osborn and Thanos for nearly every Villain and was never checked against the collection. Nothing physical to move.",
 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Doom Connive (Villains)",
 "notes": [
  "v2, Oct 17, 2026: rebuilt from the full card pool (not limited to cards in the Doom Wheel deck), no wheel package. Not checked against your collection.",
  "Plan: every connive draws, makes a Robot Villain (Ultron, pay 1), puts a +1/+1 counter on every Villain (Iron Monger), and drains 6 when you discard a land (Doom). Win with flying Villain combat plus drains. Glorious Purpose turns six connives into four free cards.",
  "Connive sources: Doom (combat), Ultron and Kang (attack), Leader (each combat, plus a draw per connive), M.O.D.O.K. (pay 3 life, repeatable on your turn), Prowler (each Villain entering, including tokens), Baron Strucker, Madame Masque, A.I.M. Scientists, Doc Ock's Henchmen, Mob Lookout, Scorpion, Norman, Ledger Shredder, Mask of the Schemer, Change of Plans, Lethal Scheme, Villainous Hideout, Spymaster's Vault.",
  "Second-draw payoffs (connive draws count): Red Ghost (3/3 haste Ape Villain), Kang (drain 1, gain 1), Madame Masque (2/1 menace Villain), M.O.D.O.K., Evil Intellect (opponent sacrifices a nontoken creature). Loki, God of Mischief draws off Doom's targeted connive, so the first connive each turn is usually the second draw.",
  "Game Changers (3): Orcish Bowmasters, Rhystic Study, The One Ring.",
  "Bracket 3 flag: Ultron + Prowler loop is bounded (each Robot costs {1}; Green Goblin's Treasures enter tapped). Never add Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Altar or Krark-Clan Ironworks. Mention it at the table.",
  "Wipe plan: Kindred Dominance naming Villain is one-sided; Change of Plans can phase your team out in response to a wipe; Behold the Sinister Six! and Robot Domination rebuild.",
  "Avoid Lightning Greaves: shroud stops Doom's own connive target.",
  "Not simulated yet. Estimate: engine online turn 5-6; wins turn 7-9 at Bracket 3 tables."
 ],
